{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"63e21abaf3816f96649e5872f3440a6102de19694564a86f7a8af3e4b5ac3c46","ja":"どうやら、事務室には誰もいないようですね。","zh":"看来事务所里好像没有人呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0baa9e2f6d24ef263dd203923bec31439c55a2bdd352e38c9e2af14c9d2abe24","ja":"でもでも、●●●●プロデューサーちゃんが今日、\n劇場に来てるって情報は掴んでるんだよ！","zh":"但是但是，我已经掌握了●●●●小制作人今天\n来了剧场的情报哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7730ca07d246100354248a8a43bc768048df2468c370a225a82190c02b95c501","ja":"じゃあ、他の部屋にいるんですかね？","zh":"那会是在其他房间吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7f1e024563296231f65d405f6ecde600ad39a5cb9859de32a316476eab987ccb","ja":"もしかして、●●●●プロデューサーは\n私たちの気配を察して隠れたのやもしれませんね。","zh":"莫非，●●●●制作人是\n察觉到了我们的气息，所以藏起来了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"89a6d6a9b76870cecabb0dadb6422c1879152437b0aebb4b99f06d4ccd57d903","ja":"ぐぬぬぬぬ……こうなったら、お年玉……もとい、\n●●●●プロデューサーちゃんを絶対見つけてやるー！","zh":"呜呜呜……既然这样，压岁钱……不对，\n我一定要把●●●●小制作人找出来——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"dac88798d78d1019c6226c2a4571c2215032ac68fe5dd49d6b549b1f8db8a883","ja":"茜さん、飛び出して行っちゃいましたね……。","zh":"茜小姐跑出去了呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"75b8543a74951e5a2c2a7b295b2c1bf395612000c8affa3d7fd4536ab91b69ff","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーちゃん、お年玉！\n茜ちゃんにお年玉ちょーだーい！","zh":"●●●●制作人，压岁钱！\n给小茜压岁钱嘛——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b58022aba764ef275c64b9044dbdd1ab0facdb5b8f648c06a49a8356da06622c","ja":"果たして、茜はお年玉はもらえるのでしょうか？","zh":"茜究竟能不能拿到压岁钱呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"49314b93929fb05018d249d4743363780104dadeadb6a1452c6c2233681e3705","ja":"あれだけ大きな声で「お年玉ー！」って叫んでたら、\n●●●●プロデューサーさんも逃げちゃいそうですね。","zh":"叫得那么大声要“压岁钱——！”，\n●●●●制作人怕是也要吓跑了吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"357981d77258c9dd364fab97bb903db7d0fe22371e706869e32f45b8d1017851","ja":"ふふっ。しかし、新年から笑顔でこんなに楽しい日を\n過ごせるとは……今年はよい年になりそうです。","zh":"呵呵。不过，从新年伊始就能满脸笑容度过\n如此开心的一天……看来今年会是个好年景呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1349.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c1b25d997c8f00ab411af3917f159bdb690c4dd86251a825b0dde174e754c18c","ja":"えへへ、そうですね♪\n笑顔で新年～♪　楽しい年になる予感～♪","zh":"嘿嘿，是啊♪\n带着笑容迎新年～♪ 感觉会是快乐的一年～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
